{"id": "68834", "title": "[黑洞]狼的温床", "author": "总攻大人", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68834.htm", "intro": "我看着躺在自己身边这个清瘦文雅颇有学者风度的男人，\r\n仿佛看见了自己未来黑暗无望的生活。\r\n是他带我走入光明，也是他亲手将我拉入黑暗。\r\n我低头看看自己的胸前，\r\n仿佛还能看见代表爱和正义的红领巾随风飘扬，我到底是什么时候变成坏人的？\r\n\r\n也许……\r\n是从我都不知道他到底在干什么，居然就在帮他的时候。\r\n爱情，或许就是哪怕你爱的人杀人放火走私贩毒无恶不作变态深井病，你都愿意跟随吧。\r\n\r\n文名去掉了俩字，免得你们老联想到郎的诱惑，顺便换了个装逼的文案，捂脸。 \r\n本文是一个大灰狼努力营造出一种伟光正假相来培育小幼苗的故事，这文一点都不虐", "base": "files/article/html/68/68834", "chapters": [{"title": "背景介绍", "file": "10548250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "10548251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章", "file": "10548597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章", "file": "10548252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "10548253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "10548254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章", "file": "10548255.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "10548256.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章", "file": "10548257.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "10548258.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "10548259.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "10548260.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "10548261.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "10548262.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "10548263.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "10548264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "10548265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "10548266.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "10548267.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "10548268.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "10548269.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "10548270.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "10548271.html", "available": false}